                  "variable": [
                    {
                      "id": "267baa82-dafa-423b-b222-ede7ba7bba28",
                      "key": "creative ID"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "A Creative can be deleted. Use DELETE method to delete a creative that meets one of the following conditions. To start the process of deleting other creative, update the status to\u00a0`PENDING_DELETION`.\n\n\\*   It is in a DRAFT state.\n\\*   It is linked to a Campaign in a DRAFT state.\n\\*   It is a video ad creative and\u00a0`processingState`\u00a0is\u00a0`PROCESSING_FAILED`.\n    \n\nThe header X-RestLi-Method must be included in the request and set to\u00a0`DELETE`."
              },
